# Renders are regenerable and land beside the strip that produced them.
strips/*/rendered/**
strips/.rendered/**

strip_editor/node_modules/
strip_editor/package-lock.json

# Everything else under strips/ IS tracked. strip.html, copy.md, images/ and
# screenshots/ are the design: move the folder, or clone the repo, and the strip
# still renders. That is the whole reason they live together.

